name: El Alamein
chapter: 13
when: 1942
where: the Qattara line, Egypt
who: Montgomery's Eighth Army vs Rommel's Panzerarmee
road: sand
fill: ,
brief: Forty miles of desert between the sea and the Qattara Depression, which no tank could cross. For once in North Africa there was no open flank, so both sides mined the ground and went straight at it.
